150}], "start": 184, "status": 200, "title": "Frontier AI Security: Managing Vulnerabilities and How the Network Can Help", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5OQfetW1CaM", "url": "https://t.co/H1OewBOj7F"}]}, "id": "2113471284692586949", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Frontier AI is accelerating vulnerability discovery—and attackers can exploit those vulnerabilities, too with LoneStar Advisory Chief Analyst Will Townsend and David Hughes, SVP, HPE. https://t.co/H1OewBOj7F", "url": "https://x.com/VinobaM1/status/2113471284692586949"}, {"author_id": "195620273", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:15:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113424023174672778"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "We asked 12 AI models for their most controversial opinion of humans, three times each. 29 of 35 answers were the same one: we care more about belonging than about the truth.", "display_url": "modelcompare.ai/blog/ai-models…", "end": 202, "expanded_url": "https://www.modelcompare.ai/blog/ai-models-controversial-take-on-humans", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113114142710038528/Sin-Fgb2?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113114142710038528/Sin-Fgb2?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 179, "status": 200, "title": "Every AI model has the same “controversial” take on humans", "unwound_url": "https://www.modelcompare.ai/blog/ai-models-controversial-take-on-humans", "url": "https://t.co/KEXMCAbF2M"}]}, "id": "2113424023174672778", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ask every frontier AI model the same hard question about humans and they converge on the same answer. Alignment training is flattening model personality into one corporate voice. https://t.co/KEXMCAbF2M", "url": "https://x.com/DanteMMartin/status/2113424023174672778"}, {"author_id": "195620273", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:15:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113423937464062381"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Camila Grigera Naón / Fortune: a16z rebrands a16z Crypto as a16z Frontier and expands the fund's scope to back startups developing AI, robotics, and other emerging technologies", "display_url": "techmeme.com/261022/p56#a26…", "end": 167, "expanded_url": "https://www.techmeme.com/261022/p56#a261022p56", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113423937925439488/NnQhHmlI?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113423937925439488/NnQhHmlI?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 144, "status": 200, "title": "a16z rebrands a16z Crypto as a16z Frontier and expands the fund's scope to back startups developing AI, robotics, and other emerging technologies", "unwound_url": "https://www.techmeme.com/261022/p56#a261022p56", "url": "https://t.co/loe3wa6zok"}]}, "id": "2113423937464062381", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "a16z Crypto is now a16z Frontier — AI and robotics, with a crypto past. The loudest crypto fund in the valley just admitted where the trade is. https://t.co/loe3wa6zok", "url": "https://x.com/DanteMMartin/status/2113423937464062381"}, {"author_id": "623619565", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:15:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113408929573097889"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 236, "start": 233, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 241, "start": 237, "tag": "LLM"}]}, "id": "2113408929573097889", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Someone asked 12 frontier AI models for their most controversial opinion about humans. 83% landed on the same take: we pick group loyalty over truth. The robots have consensus — we're not irrational, just fangirls with a group chat. #AI #LLM", "url": "https://x.com/guop128/status/2113408929573097889"}, {"author_id": "2090687681034620928", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:30:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113382398629216744"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Fujiwara96576/…", "end": 247, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Fujiwara96576/status/2112699366259450226", "start": 224, "url": "https://t.co/Z4knzaTyOe"}]}, "id": "2113382398629216744", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112699366259450226", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "chinese can't possibly be this good! they are probably using some advanced frontier AI help! 😂🙏☠️ we indians even at peak erstwhile twitter domination were not even a fraction as good as what chinese have done in few days 🙏 https://t.co/Z4knzaTyOe", "url": "https://x.com/added84/status/2113382398629216744"}, {"author_id": "36095162", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:04:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113421317517021491"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 219, "id": "1714580962569588736", "start": 207, "username": "deepseek_ai"}]}, "id": "2113421317517021491", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DeepSeek is wrapping up a reported $15B raise at a ~$74B valuation, with CATL and Tencent leading, days after the US ordered its tech out of federal agencies. The frontier AI money war is officially global. @deepseek_ai", "url": "https://x.com/srinisankar/status/2113421317517021491"}, {"author_id": "2788285300", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:10:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113453059003367707"], "id": "2113453059003367707", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2402, "like_count": 120, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "One thing I do believe is that frontier AI labs are far more integrated with the state than is publicly disclosed. There is no way the NSA is not all the way up those dude’s asses.", "url": "https://x.com/WB_Baskerville/status/2113453059003367707"}, {"author_id": "2099872638655234048", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:04:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113421168384639171"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/YarkoLEE/statu…", "end": 219, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/YarkoLEE/status/2113355114702602655", "start": 196, "url": "https://t.co/oLWTCP7x3g"}]}, "id": "2113421168384639171", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113355114702602655", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The headline was Nasdaq −2%. The actual story is frontier AI funding itself with debt. When the richest AI names borrow to keep the lights on, risk assets don’t get a free pass — crypto included. https://t.co/oLWTCP7x3g", "url": "https://x.com/hey_miyabi/status/2113421168384639171"}, {"author_id": "2074329410115682304", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:38:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113384499673436485"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "A world-leading academic lab catalyzing open frontier AI research, uniting top machine-learning groups at Oxford, UCL, and Imperial under one ambitious vision.", "display_url": "bold-lab.ai/opportunities/", "end": 276, "expanded_url": "https://bold-lab.ai/opportunities/", "start": 253, "status": 200, "title": "BOLD Lab", "unwound_url": "https://bold-lab.ai/opportunities/", "url": "https://t.co/C3ndM3RFjH"}]}, "id": "2113384499673436485", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Introduce yourself to BOLD Lab if you want to work on open frontier AI.\n\nThe Oxford, UCL and Imperial lab is collecting interest from prospective PhD students, visitors, research engineers and collaborators. The form lets it contact you about openings.\nhttps://t.co/C3ndM3RFjH", "url": "https://x.com/thebylinehq/status/2113384499673436485"}, {"author_id": "3139551624", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:02:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113466157164601472"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/kevinweil/stat…", "end": 269, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/kevinweil/status/2113294657673466060", "start": 246, "url": "https://t.co/4QXsXIAo4s"}]}, "id": "2113466157164601472", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 4718, "like_count": 61, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113294657673466060", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "RSI for drug development! Warp Sciences is automating preclinical research by combining robotics with frontier AI. This creates a recursive feedback loop between data and models to accelerate drug development. Huge congratulations on the launch! https://t.co/4QXsXIAo4s", "url": "https://x.com/istoica05/status/2113466157164601472"}, {"author_id": "450118868", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:15:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113393872089035190"], "id": "2113393872089035190", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 422, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "frontier AI labs acted as only they were capable of building breakthrough intelligence\n\nnow, they are forced to compete with hyperscalers i.e Meta &amp; SpaceXAI, ++ infinite perpetually improving open source models \n\nit makes sense why they fought so hard for regulatory capture", "url": "https://x.com/chris_devv/status/2113393872089035190"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2113415748404277248", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113380051538300928", "type": "photo"}], "users": [{"id": "1459661471047028737", "name": "Michael Zhao", "username": "michaelzhao_"}, {"id": "1469891215717974016", "name": "JUST G - The Blockhain Gods arc", "username": "TBG_JUST_G"}, {"id": "520078869", "name": "Lee Penkman", "username": "LeeLeepenkman"}, {"id": "1999726854031441923", "name": "Muiruri ⚔️", "username": "MuiruriMbau"}, {"id": "1634204856830263296", "name": "MaxTheo", "username": "SeoulCrusher11"}, {"id": "1175141550847856641", "name": "The Operator Suite", "username": "Ken98001712"}, {"id": "1690641880260943872", "name": "Eric Damon", "username": "iamerickdamon"}, {"id": "1211370089125044224", "name": "UNDERCODE TESTING", "username": "UndercodeUpdate"}, {"id": "162615017", "name": "John", "username": "JohnMcKeownn"}, {"id": "794234934416306176", "name": "Evan Reilly", "username": "verymidengineer"}, {"id": "1563655199276896256", "name": "Chats Wick", "username": "ChatsWick"}, {"id": "1514425816918409220", "name": "Vinoba M", "username": "VinobaM1"}, {"id": "195620273", "name": "Dante Martin", "username": "DanteMMartin"}, {"id": "623619565", "name": "dreamer", "username": "guop128"}, {"id": "2090687681034620928", "name": "adder death", "username": "added84"}, {"id": "36095162", "name": "Srinivasan Sankar", "username": "srinisankar"}, {"id": "2788285300", "name": "🅱️askerville", "username": "WB_Baskerville"}, {"id": "2099872638655234048", "name": "Minase Miyabi | みやび", "username": "hey_miyabi"}, {"id": "2074329410115682304", "name": "bylinehq", "username": "thebylinehq"}, {"id": "3139551624", "name": "Ion Stoica", "username": "istoica05"}, {"id": "450118868", "name": "Chris Dev", "username": "chris_devv"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2113472125894041610", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlwtp2klw7gi45mvfwtzw1t4ibgd", "oldest_id": "2113380108778283063", "result_count": 25}}
